error[elab/operator-binop-type-mismatch]: operator '+' is not defined for 'bool' and 'nat'
  ┌─ elab/operator-binary-left-type.watsup:2:10
  │
1 │ dec $f : nat
  │          --- return value of function '$f' expects 'nat'
2 │ def $f = true + 1
  │          ^^^^   ^ right operand has type 'nat'
  │          │       
  │          left operand has type 'bool'

